WEBVTT

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:18.180
If you were to walk so the wind fluttered the edge of your cape,

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:24.570
people would look up at you in quiet admiration.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:31.870
You can say spicy things like "it's not my style," if you want,

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.290
but I know who you really are because I'm your friend!

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:40.160
Stand! Bow!

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.690
Nice and orderly now!

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:45.530
And once that's done,

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:50.800
it's time to start the school day.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:58.420
I like Mondays because I can see all my friends.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:04.820
There's nothing wrong with being abnormally happy.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:11.990
At lunch break, we have tea in the Royal Garden,

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:19.330
where I tell you all my secrets!

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:36.450
Episode 102
The Dream Egg, Who I Want to Be.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:40.000
What am I sensing?

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.410
The Embryo is sad.

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:04.180
What...

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:05.900
Something's coming!

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:07.770
A huge power...

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.100
It's scary...

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.540
There are so many...

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:34.290
It looks like they're searching for something.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.480
What's happening?

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:39.910
Boss?

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:40.970
The stones...

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.510
My stones...

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.720
My...

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.520
How come he's scooping them up so desperately?

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.860
Do they mean that much to him?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.480
Wh-What is it?

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.110
What are you doing?!

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.530
Stop this at once!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:02.800
Everyone!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.620
Stop!

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:11.620
Boss!

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.250
Hikaru-kun!

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:20.670
The Embryo's gone!

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.470
Boss...

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:32.850
Let's go!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:33.810
Right.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.400
Character Transformation: Black Lynx!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.030
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.830
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.440
Guys!

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.870
Amu-chi, Tadase!

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:19.400
Give us a hand, everyone! There's a boy trapped inside!

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.520
Who is that?

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.580
The Boss.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.450
That boy is actually the Boss.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:34.980
The Boss is a little kid?

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:41.860
Ikuto-niisan!

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:42.760
Got it.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.780
Slash Claw!

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:47.390
Holy Saber!

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:08.870
It's restoring itself.

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:13.790
White Wing!

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.290
Tightrope Dancer!

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:30.010
That's my little duckies!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.610
Are you okay?

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.580
Why is it screaming?

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:00.750
It sounds like someone crying out in sorrow!

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:13.130
The X Character... The X Eggs... Are they crying?

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:16.990
It's the X Eggs' negative energy

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:19.640
from the sadness they're all holding inside.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:25.090
With so much of it gathered in one body... I can hardly imagine the amount of negative energy it holds.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.910
Was that... my sadness?

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.830
What's the matter, Rima-chan?

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.610
I don't know...

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:41.370
I just suddenly remembered when my mom and dad had a big fight...

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:47.130
Yaya, can that racket!

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:50.130
But you're crying, too, Utau-chan!

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.300
It's drawing out everyone's sadness!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:58.050
We all have sad feelings somewhere inside our hearts...

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:01.960
But it's usually bottled up, so it can't get out.

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:06.810
But now, that scream is taking the lid right off!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:14.840
Amu-chan, at this rate all the people in the city will be sad!

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.100
I have to stop it.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:24.520
Hikaru-kun? Aren't you sad, too?

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.000
There's no point to crying.

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:30.300
The emotion of "sadness" serves no purpose.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.980
Hikaru-kun!

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:49.430
Director Hoshino?

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.230
This is all I can do for you...

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.990
True. You are no help to me otherwise.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:02.340
You are powerless and worthless.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.080
That's not true!

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:08.060
There's no such thing as a worthless person!

00:08:08.060 --> 00:08:10.680
Hikaru-kun, you said something like that before.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:13.880
You called snacks worthless and useless.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:16.640
But I remember.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.310
I remember how happy you looked when we ate that taiyaki together.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.450
It tasted good, right?

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:25.730
It did.

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:31.180
So that means... what it nourishes is your heart.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:00.780
Nothing out there is worthless!

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:05.310
All things, no matter what, are born into this world because someone needs them!

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.860
Slash Claw!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.050
Holy Crown!

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:24.730
Amu-chan, we'll support you.

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.750
Do what you have to do.

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:34.710
Tough times will come... Times that are so sad you might cry...

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:38.520
But we'll stand up and face them.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.550
We'll fight!

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:44.850
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.530
Open Heart Full Volume!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.350
It smiled!

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.860
This is what I, as a girl, can do for you.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:37.450
A lucky four-leaf clover...

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.360
Four hearts...

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:45.040
In the language of flowers, when they become one...

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.280
it means "true love."

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:54.360
It's beautiful...

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:23.910
Is it really true that all things are born because they are needed by someone?

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:28.780
Yes, and that includes you. There's definitely a reason you were born.

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:30.910
I'm sure someone wished for it.

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.000
Let me see.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.850
You're gripping it so tightly your palm's red.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.350
Why do you collect stones?

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.270
To fill the void.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:50.450
The void?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:54.190
There is nothing I can't obtain if I wish for it.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:02.770
But with each possession I gained, still I felt the void inside me.

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:08.200
Collecting pretty stones was an attempt to fill it.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:14.250
But no matter how many I got, the void remained.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:27.310
No gem in the world can fill the emptiness in your heart.

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:32.640
Because it's your feelings themselves that are the true sparkling treasure.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:34.440
Feelings?

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.870
For family, friends, the people you like.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:42.140
Knowing how important they are to you...

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:43.890
Believing in them...

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:45.740
Loving them...

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:51.410
That's a treasure no one can bring to you.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.640
You have to find it, to feel it, yourself.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:56.030
I do?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:56.750
Yup.

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:03.760
So what I've been searching for... were feelings?

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:06.930
Right. Your heart's egg.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:12.640
But mine's been empty since the day I was born. There's nothing there.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:16.090
This is nothing but a foolish dream!

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:17.270
It's completely worthless!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.740
That's totally wrong!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.750
Guardian Characters are always on your side!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:31.060
I'm sure even your heart's egg is right nearby!

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:33.350
You just haven't realized it yet.

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:36.560
As long as you believe, it can be reborn again and again!

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:44.400
The Embryo?

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:53.430
It's been sparkling brightly all this time, searching for you.

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:10.420
That's Hikaru-kun's heart's egg?

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:52.620
Hikaru-kun...

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:56.960
You were sad, weren't you?

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.040
Your whole life.

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:04.620
Hikaru, all I've ever wanted was for you to be happy.

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:09.630
But... you wouldn't even allow him to cry.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.810
Boss, you have economics next.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:16.380
The tutor will be here shortly.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.310
And then...

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:27.640
He threw away his own heart.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:33.340
So that he would never feel the depth of his loneliness and sorrow.

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:44.620
Nor the love showered upon him before his own eyes.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:49.090
What... What should I do?

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.880
The answer is simple.

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:08.690
Hikaru. I'm sorry for everything...

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.920
Please, forgive your grandpa!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:38.020
So in the end, that wasn't the Embryo.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:41.560
I'm sure we'll find the real Embryo someday.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.880
Yeah, for sure!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:46.960
Hey, what about that picture book?

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:49.210
The final page!

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:55.590
Hikaru-kun, I think you should be able to tell everyone the conclusion of that story now.

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:57.620
Please tell us, Hikaru-kun!

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.810
Who wants to know?

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:00.790
We do!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.100
The end of the story?

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.600
Yeah!

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:08.480
Nothing was written.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:09.970
It was just a blank page.

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:16.050
You've got to be kidding!

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.880
How is that possible?!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:19.890
It's the way it should be.

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:23.570
We're all the main characters of our own stories.

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:27.540
Therefore, we should write the end of our stories ourselves.

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:30.470
Our tales continue on pages yet unwritten.

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:35.710
That's the essence of the heart's egg within us all.

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:41.340
Ikuto-niisan...

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:45.210
Please hold on to Dumpty Key.

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:54.800
Inside the light, I saw that it was something passed down from your father, Tsukiyomi Aruto-san.

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:58.720
Yeah...

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:02.720
So why didn't you just tell me in the first place?

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.260
Like he'd admit it-nya.

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:07.940
Ikuto's a hopelessly stubborn fool, nya-know.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.490
Look here, you.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.000
I've really worked up an appetite!

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.570
I'm starvin'!

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:20.120
No kidding!

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:24.410
Say, Ikuto, who'd that black egg come from?

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:27.200
Oh, my old man.

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.620
He's still alive.

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:32.780
Somewhere, under this same sky...

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:34.870
Are you gonna go look for him?

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.640
Amu.

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:44.100
I have a secret to confess.

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.940
I-Ikuto-niisan!

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:56.960
Amu, what did you just do?!

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:59.610
I didn't do a thing! He did it to me!

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.120
Hey, whaddaya think you're-

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.480
Later.

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:15.360
He left.

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:17.120
He sure plays to his own tune...

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.730
You can say that again.

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:40.240
Thanks to our brilliant actions, we spoiled Easter's evil plans to take over the world!

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.740
They weren't trying to take over the world.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.190
They were just searching for the Embryo.

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:47.390
Kiseki, you always make everything so...

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.750
...overblown!

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:52.710
Wow, look at Hikaru-kun.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:55.990
The young mastermind behind the Easter Company.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.580
I've got big news!

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:02.550
Utau-chan's gonna have another concert!

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:04.750
This is big! Totally great!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:08.030
Whoa! We're doing a concert here?

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:09.430
Yay!

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:12.880
We've finally come this far.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:15.770
This far? Isn't this only the beginning?

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:17.690
Indeed.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.860
It's from this stage...

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.000
...that our legend...

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.190
...begins!

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:27.810
But isn't that office going to be a little cramped from now on?

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:30.840
I've already got moving plans figured out.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:34.600
Why am I doing this?

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.950
Forget you, what about me?

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:41.300
You called me all the way out to Tokyo just to move your office?

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:42.600
So that's the reason...

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:44.480
You look pretty strong.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:46.680
...she said that.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:50.230
This is quite a hindrance to us Guardian Characters as well.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.470
No kidding.

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:53.560
I sense something!

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.930
Yeah!

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:56.670
Kairi! Kukai-dono!

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:58.080
We sense X Eggs!

00:20:58.080 --> 00:20:59.290
X Eggs?

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:01.530
You're not going?

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:07.090
Now that Easter's gone, I think we should leave the X Eggs to those guys.

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:10.850
Yes. I'm sure Hinamori-san and the others can handle them.

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:18.540
This is a dead end!

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.670
Hey, Amu-chan...

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:28.740
Do you love Ikuto-niisan?

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:31.920
L-Love him? I h-hardly even like him!

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.760
W-Why do you ask?

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:35.980
It's just been bothering me for a while.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:41.380
You know, you were really dazzling.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:47.220
You were so cool, and everyone always admired you.

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:51.370
That's why I think I naturally started looking up to you, too.

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:57.750
But now, it's not that I look up to you... I see you for who you really are.

00:21:57.970 --> 00:21:59.420
Amu-chan...

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:03.040
Amu-chan!

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:04.250
They're here!

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:05.580
Tadase-kun!

00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:10.680
Amu-chan!

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:12.220
Okay!

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:16.140
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:18.450
Open Heart!

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:27.490
We did it!

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:33.410
The hearts' eggs are going back to their owners.

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:37.390
We're all the main characters of our own stories.

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:41.020
We all decide on our own who we want to be!

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:43.490
No one else can make that decision!

00:22:43.490 --> 00:22:46.170
That's why we grab hold of it ourselves...

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:49.220
The person we want to be inside our hearts.

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:53.690
That's our own personal treasure. That's our heart's egg.

00:22:54.710 --> 00:22:56.850
Having a little moment with each other again?

00:22:57.180 --> 00:22:59.200
N-No, we're not!

00:22:59.200 --> 00:23:00.580
They even breathe in tandem.

00:23:00.580 --> 00:23:02.110
Perfect harmony.

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:07.600
Sheesh! Be quiet, all of you!

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:55.160
Thank you!
